	torch. ones, zeros, rand, randn
	nn.Linear, ReLu, Softmax, Sequential
		其实是函数式的 nn.Relu()(val)

如何 grad:
	w = torch.randn(5, 3, requires_grad=True)
	b = torch.randn(3, requires_grad=True)
	...
	loss = torch.nn.functional.binary_cross_entropy_with_logits(z, y)
	loss.backward()
	print(w.grad)
	print(b.grad)

	可以暂时关掉 autograd 如果只需要 fw 计算，加速
	with torch.no_grad():
	    z = torch.matmul(x, w)+b

扩散是马尔科夫过程，所以才能 P(X_{0:T}) = P(X_T) \prod P(X_{i-1}|X_i)
